    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansion VR</strong> is a thrilling tower rush RTS built for virtual reality, throwing you into intense PvP and PvE battles where every second counts.<br>Strategize on the fly, build your deck, and deploy powerful units in real-time as you fight to destroy your opponent\u2019s Command Tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending the best elements of collectible card games, tower defense, and multiplayer online battle arenas, <strong>Expansion VR</strong> delivers fast-paced, strategic combat in a fully immersive VR environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win battles to unlock new units, refine your deck, and master the battlefield like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The galaxy awaits. Will you rise to the challenge?</strong><br>Dive into the fight. Embark on a VR journey like no other\u2014only in <strong>Expansion</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/ff70f5a90b2d6ed9020cca209b06c492.avif?t=1744201258\" width=621 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prior to each battle, players construct a deck of units and abilities which they use to attack and defend against their opponent.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/16f4873788ade2a0c31d9a908a994738.poster.avif?t=1744201258\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/16f4873788ade2a0c31d9a908a994738.webm?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/16f4873788ade2a0c31d9a908a994738.mp4?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the battle Players manage Energy - a resource used to call reinforcments. Skillful combination and placement of units is a way to outsmart opponents and achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/9c356d8a0036510e1ec62d4c0ed2793d.poster.avif?t=1744201258\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/9c356d8a0036510e1ec62d4c0ed2793d.webm?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/9c356d8a0036510e1ec62d4c0ed2793d.mp4?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game is set in an immersive sci-fi environment in Virtual Reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/a7ac294dbfec469140871781bf3d5565.poster.avif?t=1744201258\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/a7ac294dbfec469140871781bf3d5565.webm?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/a7ac294dbfec469140871781bf3d5565.mp4?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/8e1200f12333692957770afa423f6e1a.avif?t=1744201258\" width=621 height=118 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>These are your asteroids, your mining space.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the vast expanses of outer space, a battle for valuable resources has unfolded. Your Company, engaged in the lucrative mining operations, is faced with unwanted competition. To protect your interests and maintain control over valuable resources, you must gather your experienced miners, repurpose mining equipment, and enlist the help of auxiliary forces - privateers and aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your Company and battle for control over the space riches and expand dominance further and further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/7f4dd18d611316ea0e1f380c09f3aa4b.poster.avif?t=1744201258\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/7f4dd18d611316ea0e1f380c09f3aa4b.webm?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/7f4dd18d611316ea0e1f380c09f3aa4b.mp4?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansion VR</strong> is a thrilling tower rush RTS built for virtual reality, throwing you into intense PvP and PvE battles where every second counts.<br>Strategize on the fly, build your deck, and deploy powerful units in real-time as you fight to destroy your opponent\u2019s Command Tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending the best elements of collectible card games, tower defense, and multiplayer online battle arenas, <strong>Expansion VR</strong> delivers fast-paced, strategic combat in a fully immersive VR environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win battles to unlock new units, refine your deck, and master the battlefield like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The galaxy awaits. Will you rise to the challenge?</strong><br>Dive into the fight. Embark on a VR journey like no other\u2014only in <strong>Expansion</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/ff70f5a90b2d6ed9020cca209b06c492.avif?t=1744201258\" width=621 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prior to each battle, players construct a deck of units and abilities which they use to attack and defend against their opponent.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/16f4873788ade2a0c31d9a908a994738.poster.avif?t=1744201258\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/16f4873788ade2a0c31d9a908a994738.webm?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/16f4873788ade2a0c31d9a908a994738.mp4?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the battle Players manage Energy - a resource used to call reinforcments. Skillful combination and placement of units is a way to outsmart opponents and achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/9c356d8a0036510e1ec62d4c0ed2793d.poster.avif?t=1744201258\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/9c356d8a0036510e1ec62d4c0ed2793d.webm?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/9c356d8a0036510e1ec62d4c0ed2793d.mp4?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game is set in an immersive sci-fi environment in Virtual Reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/a7ac294dbfec469140871781bf3d5565.poster.avif?t=1744201258\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/a7ac294dbfec469140871781bf3d5565.webm?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/a7ac294dbfec469140871781bf3d5565.mp4?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/8e1200f12333692957770afa423f6e1a.avif?t=1744201258\" width=621 height=118 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>These are your asteroids, your mining space.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the vast expanses of outer space, a battle for valuable resources has unfolded. Your Company, engaged in the lucrative mining operations, is faced with unwanted competition. To protect your interests and maintain control over valuable resources, you must gather your experienced miners, repurpose mining equipment, and enlist the help of auxiliary forces - privateers and aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your Company and battle for control over the space riches and expand dominance further and further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/7f4dd18d611316ea0e1f380c09f3aa4b.poster.avif?t=1744201258\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/7f4dd18d611316ea0e1f380c09f3aa4b.webm?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669520/extras/7f4dd18d611316ea0e1f380c09f3aa4b.mp4?t=1744201258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
